{"title":"Water wheel/32","sourceTitle":"Water wheel/32/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>A roda d'água gera energia mecânica por conta própria, desde que suas pás estejam em água fluindo rapidamente. A saída é entregue através do hub no centro da roda, que se conecta à rede mais ampla via <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Wooden_axle\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Wooden axle\">wooden axles</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Wooden_axle\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wooden axle\"> </a></span> e <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Angled_gear\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Angled gear\">angled gears</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Angled_gear\" title=\"Angled gear\"> </a></span>.\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111120801\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.003 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.003 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 43/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 346/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 136/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.917      1 -total\n 97.50%    0.894      2 Template:Ll\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183611-0!canonical and timestamp 20261111120801 and revision id 397229. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>","sections":[],"revid":397229,"sourceUrl":"https://wiki.vintagestory.at/index.php?title=Water_wheel%2F32%2Fpt-br","capturedAt":"2026-11-11T12:08:01.796Z"}